## 5. Shooting and weapon pose

| Concern | Where | Notes |
|---------|-------|-------|
| Server hit detection + spawn | `BulletSimulationSystem` | Burst, authoritative |
| Muzzle origin / forward | `ShipWeaponPose.TryResolve` | Shared math; used by sim and client VFX |
| Client tracer VFX | `ClientLocalBulletVfxBridge` | VFX only; reads predicted ECS pose |
| Cooldown / energy | `ShipWeaponState`, `ShipState` | Server sim |

Client VFX may anticipate shots; **damage and bullet entities are server-authoritative.**

