## 6. Legacy code — migrate toward this doc, do not extend

| Current | Target action |
|---------|---------------|
| `EcsWorldVisualizer` local ship lerp | Remove; use presentation transform directly |
| `ShipMovementLogic` + `EntityManager` in hot path | Burst job + pre-baked components |
| `SystemBase` movement systems | Burst `ISystem` |
| `ClientLocalBulletVfxBridge` LateUpdate ECS reads | Presentation or sim spawn events |
| `GhostPresentationTransformCache` | Temporary bridge; document as hybrid-only |

When fixing jitter/lag: tune tick rate, `GhostPredictionSmoothing`, physics step — **do not** remove prediction or physics.

**Ask the user before changing the prediction model or removing client prediction.**

