## 8. Pre-submit checklist

- [ ] Owner still predicted on client (`ShipClientPredictedMovementSystem` + `Simulate`)?
- [ ] Server and client call the **same** `ShipMovementLogic.StepShip`?
- [ ] Motor sets velocity/rotation only; physics integrates position?
- [ ] Ship/planet/asteroid collisions via Unity Physics layers?
- [ ] No new proxy or camera smoothing on local owner movement?
- [ ] Hot path Burst-compatible or clearly marked with migration TODO?
- [ ] Shooting server-authoritative in `BulletSimulationSystem`?
- [ ] New/changed code has file summary + non-obvious inline comments per section 7?
